{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016rcL8Pf6nCAxENYMNjJd6U","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-17\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| temperature-ablation-t10 | Temperature ablation T=1.0: 高温下 Qwen2.5-14B trace diversity 最大化（C0 预期>60%），SICA-SC gap 预期≈0 或负——验证最大 diversity 仍不能拯救 SICA，因为 constraint discriminative power 不随 diversity 增加 | — | — | — |\\\\n| temperature-ablation-t05 | Temperature ablation T=0.5: 中温下 Qwen2.5-14B trace diversity 中等（C0 预期 30-45%），SICA-SC gap 预期≈0——验证即使 diversity 适中，constraint quality 仍为瓶颈 | — | — | — |\\\\n| temperature-ablation-t03 | Temperature ablation T=0.3: 低温下 Qwen2.5-14B trace diversity 降低（C0 预期<30%），SICA-SC gap 预期≈0——验证 diversity 不足时 SICA 无操作空间，capability trap 的下界 | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- smoke-test-5q（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp-014-deepseek-r1-7b** (negative): DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B（reasoning distill 模型）在 D012 上 SICA vs SC——预期 C0<5%（类似 QwQ-32B，reasoning model 的确定性链消灭多样性），作为第二个 reasoning model 数据点验证 capability trap ← 基于 sica_expanded_14b\\\\n- **exp-010-mistral-v3** (negative): Cross-family validation: Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 在 D012 数据集(30PW+30FOLIO)上是否复现 SICA≈SC pattern——验证 capability trap 跨模型家族泛化（v3: 脚本内含 vLLM 清理+conda 环境，解决 v2 SIGTERM 问题） ← 基于 sica_expanded_14b\\\\n- **sica_expanded_14b** (success): Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct 在 N=804 (600PW+204FOLIO) 上 SICA 相比 SC 有统计显著优势（p<0.05）——full-scale validation of D012 preliminary +3.3pp signal ← 基于 sica_d012_14b\\\\n  [sica_expanded_14b](/api/workspace-files/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/sica_expanded_14b/data/sica_expanded_14b_config.txt) | [exp001_full_analysis](/api/workspace-files/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/sica_expanded_14b/report/exp001_analysis_summary.txt)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 12 / 负向 7 / 失败 9 / 共 34\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-32608: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_math50_t07: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- sica_aime30_t07: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- sica_aime30_v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- sica_aime30_v3: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- sica_proofwriter30: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sica_folio30: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- sica_proofwriter30_v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp-011-llama8b: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp-010-mistral: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp-011-llama8b-v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp-017-strategyqa: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp-018-arc: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp-010-mistral-v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp-017-strategyqa-v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- pilot-contrastive-prompt: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2324, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01S5V8SG9KMqFCCkcX4hcTN5","session_id":"1bafea0c-3dcc-4cf8-a7a2-52faa8778916","uuid":"d02db99c-a49e-4605-b861-35fab7a9d0c6","timestamp":"2026-05-17T15:54:11.348Z"}
