{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NoNCHFqSisESSWMJPfqZCT","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# symb_invariant_consensus — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-17 15:48 UTC | 更新原因: 标记已完成 CPU tasks + 更新 D036 进展\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**D025 Capability Trap Analysis Paper (FINAL)**：SICA ≈ SC everywhere。Constraints lack discriminative power regardless of diversity level. 详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research → Writing transition（D035/D036 确认最终方向 + 补充实验）\\\\n- **关键结论**:\\\\n  - 五个模型全部 negative: Qwen-14B +0.25pp, Mistral-7B 0pp, LLaMA-8B -2.4pp/+2.0pp, DeepSeek-R1-7B -3.3pp\\\\n  - exp-013: MaxSAT ≈ count-only（mechanism vacuous）\\\\n  - exp-015: Logic-LM baseline 无优势（62.7% vs SC 63.2%）\\\\n  - exp-009: SICA +48.7% overhead，全来自 LLM extraction\\\\n  - F2 per-problem 数据就绪（n=307, vote_entropy ρ=0.36）\\\\n  - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B 重分类为 instruction-scale（C0=58%，非 reasoning model）\\\\n- **已完成实验**: 12 个 success + 6 个 informative negative\\\\n- **D036 补充实验**: temperature ablation 运行中，GSM8K/Qwen-7B/Mistral-StrategyQA 脚本就绪\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] exp-009: overhead analysis（CPU，+48.7% wall time）\\\\n- [x] exp-015: Logic-LM baseline（CPU，无优势）\\\\n- [x] exp-016: weighted SC baseline（CPU，all n.s.）\\\\n- [x] constraint quality correlation + F2 per-problem CSV（CPU，n=307）\\\\n- [x] exp-014 DeepSeek-R1 完成（negative，C0=58%，reclassified）\\\\n- [x] registry 数据修复（C0 定义统一 + extraction_rate bug + notes）\\\\n- [ ] **temperature ablation T=0.3/0.5/1.0**（GPU 运行中，~2h remaining）\\\\n- [ ] exp-012 GSM8K pilot（GPU，temperature 后）\\\\n- [ ] exp-004 Qwen-7B scaling（GPU，symlink 已修复）\\\\n- [ ] Mistral-7B StrategyQA（GPU，脚本就绪）\\\\n- [ ] dream_simulate 结果处理（reviewing 阶段，即将完成）\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent 启动写作（dream 后）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: 1× RTX PRO 6000 Bl