{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MfvY6yR5YVK9h6rqjoUteL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CqSMAWxPuMVibbSsvosqm7","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"symb_invariant_consensus","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":195,"cache_read_input_tokens":34388,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":195,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":73,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"unavailable"}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_014ywVxmwKdSp41GtgAJEWPH","session_id":"1bafea0c-3dcc-4cf8-a7a2-52faa8778916","uuid":"f7076e87-12e0-45b7-ba03-90da7bc81a92"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CqSMAWxPuMVibbSsvosqm7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# 文献调研：Answer-Conditioned Constraint Extraction from LLM Reasoning Traces\\\\n\\\\n**日期**: 2025-05-17  \\\\n**目标**: 为 D030 methods paper 寻找从 reasoning traces 提取 answer-discriminative 约束的技术参考\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 核心问题\\\\n\\\\n当前 SICA 提取的约束是 domain facts（无论答案如何都成立），导致 MaxSAT 聚合退化为 weighted majority vote。需要提取\\\\\\\"answer=A → X 成立; answer=B → Y 成立\\\\\\\"形式的判别性约束。\\\\n\\\\n## 最相关论文\\\\n\\\\n### 1. Math-Shepherd (ACL 2024)\\\\n- **核心思路**: 对每个推理步骤，从该步续写多条路径检查能否到达正确答案。步骤标签本质上是 outcome-conditioned 的。\\\\n- **适配价值**: 可借鉴其思路——对每条约束，检查它与哪些最终答案兼容。\\\\n\\\\n### 2. GRACE (EMNLP 2023 Findings)\\\\n- 训练 step-level discriminator（对比学习），解码时引导生成正确推理步骤。\\\\n\\\\n### 3. DiVeRSe (ACL 2023)\\\\n- 多 prompt 生成多样推理路径 + step-aware verifier 逐步验证 + 加权投票。\\\\n\\\\n### 4. Multi-Agent Debate / D3 Framework (2024)\\\\n- debate 性能增益主要来自 output aggregation 而非真正的论证交互——与 SICA 退化为 majority vote 一致。\\\\n\\\\n### 5. Atomic-SNLI / NLI Decomposition (2025)\\\\n- 将假设分解为 atomic facts，逐个检查与前提的蕴含/矛盾关系。\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 失败模式记录\\\\n\\\\n- [失败模式] infrastructure/ENV_ACTIVATION：submit_training_job 提交直接 `python xxx.py` 命令时，tmux session 中 PATH 不含 conda，导致 EXIT_CODE=127。修复方案：所有命令必须加 `source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base &&` 前缀。(2026-05-17, pilot-contrastive-prompt)\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## Operating Regime 倒 U 型假说 — 已证伪 (2026-05-17)\\\\n\\\\n### 原始假说\\\\nSICA 增益在 SC accuracy ~55-65% 时存在 sweet spot（倒 U 型），由 model capability x trace diversity x constraint quality 三因素决定。基于 exp-011 LLaMA-8B +6.67pp (n=30) 的方向性正面信号。\\\\n\\\\n### 证伪证据\\\\n1. **exp-019** (n=200, StrategyQA): SICA 74% vs SC 72%, +2pp, McNemar p=0.424 — NOT significant\\\\n2. **exp-020** (n=204, FOLIO): SICA 60.8% vs SC 63.2%, -2.45pp — SC WINS (在假说预测的 sweet spot 内)\\\\n3. **exp-011 复现失败**: 同 30 题在 exp-020 中仅 56.7% agreement，+10pp 反转为 -3.3pp — Type I error (n=30 noise)\\\\n4. **所有 powered tests (n>=200) 均 non-significant**: 无任何 operating regime 存在 SICA > SC\\\\n\\\\n### 最终结论\\\\n**SICA <= SC everywhere.** 约束提取产出 domain facts 而非 answer-discriminative constraints，导致 MaxSAT 聚合退化为 noise injection。\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 关键实验发现 (2026-05-17)\\\\n\\\\n### exp-015 Logic-LM Baseline\\\\n- Logic-LM (per-trace Z3 verification) 62.7% = SC 63.2%, McNemar p=1.0\\\\n- 90.6% traces 通过自洽检查——单 trace 约束几乎不自相矛盾\\\\n- 结论：无论单 trace (Logic-LM) 还是跨 trace (SICA) 的约束验证，都不优于简单投票\\\\n\\\\n### exp-009 Overhead Analysis\\\\n- SICA +48.7% wall time over SC (30s/题)\\\\n- 几乎全部开销来自 LLM constraint extraction (47%)，MaxSAT 求解 = 0%\\\\n- 高成本低回报：extraction 产出无判别力的 domain facts\\\\n\\\\n### Constraint Quality Correlation (F2 数据)\\\\n- 逻辑域 (PW+FOLIO, FOLIO) 约束密度高 (5-9/trace)，但高密度 != 高增益\\\\n- 常识域 (StrategyQA, ARC) 约束密度极低 (~1)，几乎无法提取有意义的符号约束\\\\n- LLaMA-8B PW+FOLIO +6.67pp 是 n=60 噪声，同模型 FOLIO n=204 反转为 -2.45pp\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2486, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_014ywVxmwKdSp41GtgAJEWPH","session_id":"1bafea0c-3dcc-4cf8-a7a2-52faa8778916","uuid":"ba7f92b4-81c7-44a7-9b0f-59e68d5cd295","timestamp":"2026-05-17T15:54:53.132Z"}
